#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:174
msgid "5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "5.1 单节点在线部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:176
msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs both Prefill and Decode on the same node. "
"`Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-w8a8` can be deployed on 1 Atlas A3 inference products (64G"
" x 16) or 1 Atlas A2 inference products (64G x 8), or Atlas 300I DUO. The "
"W8A8 version needs `--quantization ascend`."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在同一节点上运行Prefill和Decode。`Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-w8a8`可以部署在1个Atlas A3推理产品（64G x "
"16）或1个Atlas A2推理产品（64G x 8）或Atlas 300I DUO上。W8A8版本需要`--quantization ascend`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md
msgid "Atlas A2 inference products / Atlas A3 inference products"
msgstr "Atlas A2 推理产品 / Atlas A3 推理产品"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:182
msgid ""
"Run the following script to execute online inference with up to 262144 "
"context length on 1 Atlas A3 inference products (64G x 16)."
msgstr "运行以下脚本在 1 个 Atlas A3 推理产品（64G x 16）上执行最长 262144 上下文长度的在线推理。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:223
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:259
msgid "**Key parameters:**"
msgstr "**关键参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:225
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size 1` and `--tensor-parallel-size 2` set DP and TP for "
"the default single-node serving example."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size 1` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 2` 为默认的单节点服务示例设置 DP 和 TP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:226
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not"
" mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。不要在同一个 MoE 层中混合使用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:227
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` is the maximum input plus output length for a single "
"request. Increase it only when enough KV cache is available."
msgstr "`--max-model-len` 是单个请求的最大输入加输出长度。仅在 KV 缓存充足时增加此值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:228
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` is the maximum number of active requests scheduled by each "
"DP group. For performance tests, set `--max-num-seqs * --data-parallel-size`"
" greater than or equal to the test concurrency."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs` 是每个 DP 组调度的最大活跃请求数。对于性能测试，请将 `--max-num-seqs * --data-"
"parallel-size` 设置为大于或等于测试并发数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:229
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one "
"scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes "
"more activation memory."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单个调度步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高预填充效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:230
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` controls how much HBM vLLM can use to calculate "
"KV cache capacity. A higher value increases KV cache size but can trigger "
"OOM if runtime memory is higher than the profile run."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` 控制 vLLM 可用于计算 KV 缓存容量的 HBM 比例。较高的值会增加 KV "
"缓存大小，但如果运行时内存高于 profile 运行时的内存，可能会触发 OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:231
msgid ""
"`--enable-prefix-caching` enables prefix caching. For long-context serving, "
"monitor memory usage because prefix caching can increase KV cache pressure."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-prefix-caching` 启用前缀缓存。对于长上下文服务，请监控内存使用情况，因为前缀缓存可能会增加 KV 缓存压力。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:232
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:268
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W8A8 model. "
"Remove this option when deploying the BF16 model."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend` 为 W8A8 模型启用昇腾量化。部署 BF16 模型时请移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:233
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full decode ACLGraph replay to reduce dispatch overhead."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 启用全解码 "
"ACLGraph 重放以减少调度开销。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:234
msgid ""
"`--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. "
"`enable_flashcomm1` enables FlashComm1, `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` "
"overlaps shared expert computation, and `enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-"
"native CPU binding."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config` 启用昇腾特定的优化。`enable_flashcomm1` 启用 "
"FlashComm1，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 重叠共享专家计算，`enable_cpu_binding`"
" 启用昇腾原生 CPU 绑定。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:235
msgid ""
"`--async-scheduling` enables asynchronous scheduling, which can improve "
"high-concurrency throughput."
msgstr "`--async-scheduling` 启用异步调度，可提升高并发吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:261
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 2` maps the model across two Atlas inference "
"devices. Adjust it together with `ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` according to "
"the available devices and memory."
msgstr ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 2` 将模型映射到两个Atlas推理设备上。请根据可用设备和内存，结合 "
"`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES` 进行调整。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:262
msgid ""
"`--dtype float16` is used for Atlas 300I DUO to match the Atlas inference "
"execution path."
msgstr "`--dtype float16`用于Atlas 300I DUO，以匹配Atlas推理执行路径。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:263
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs 16` limits concurrent active requests to reduce KV cache and"
" graph capture pressure on Atlas 300I DUO."
msgstr "`--max-num-seqs 16`限制并发活动请求数，以减少Atlas 300I DUO上的KV缓存和图捕获压力。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:264
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` controls KV cache capacity. Reduce it if startup "
"or runtime requests report OOM."
msgstr "`--gpu-memory-utilization` 控制KV缓存容量。如果启动或运行时请求报告OOM，请减小该值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:265
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--additional-config` with `\"ascend_compilation_config\": "
"{\"enable_npugraph_ex\": false}` is required because `enable_npugraph_ex` is"
" not supported on Atlas 300I DUO."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config`需要包含`\"ascend_compilation_config\": "
"{\"enable_npugraph_ex\": false}`，因为Atlas 300I DUO不支持`enable_npugraph_ex`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:266
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\", "
"\"cudagraph_capture_sizes\": [1,2,4,8,16]}'` enables decode ACLGraph replay "
"and explicitly limits capture sizes for Atlas 300I DUO."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\", "
"\"cudagraph_capture_sizes\": [1,2,4,8,16]}'`为Atlas 300I DUO启用decode "
"ACLGraph重放，并显式限制捕获大小。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:267
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` is the default recommendation for this Atlas "
"300I DUO example to reduce memory pressure."
msgstr "`--no-enable-prefix-caching`是此Atlas 300I DUO示例的默认建议，以减少内存压力。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:269
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"To enable MTP speculative decoding, use --speculative_config '{\"method\": "
"\"mtp\", \"num_speculative_tokens\": 1}'. We recommend setting "
"num_speculative_tokens to 1."
msgstr ""
"要启用MTP推测解码，请使用 --speculative_config '{\"method\": \"mtp\", "
"\"num_speculative_tokens\": 1}'。建议将 num_speculative_tokens 设置为1。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B.md:273
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the service fails to start, HBM is insufficient, or "
"requests are not scheduled as expected, refer to [FAQs](../../faqs.md) "
"first, and then check the model-specific FAQ in Section 10."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果服务启动失败、HBM不足或请求未按预期调度，请先参考[常见问题](../../faqs.md)，然后查看第10节中的模型特定FAQ。"

